OL,3,GNEWSASocial media 'spiral' found after
OL,4,Asister's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains details
OL,7,Fand references to suicide
OL,9,FA woman whose 13-year-old sister took
OL,10,Fher own life says the "spiral that she
OL,11,Fwas going through" was evident from her
OL,12,Fsocial media history.
OL,14,FBlake Gallier's death in October came
OL,15,Fas a surprise to her family, from
OL,16,FGravesend in Kent.
OL,18,FHer sister Tayla Gallier, 19, told the
OL,19,FBBC she looked through Blake's phone
OL,20,Fafter her death, having felt she
OL,21,F"needed to know" what content her
OL,22,Fsibling had seen prior to her death.
